# fly deploy uses the repo root as build context; without this every deploy
# uploaded ~2 GB (iOS Pods, node_modules) to use ~13 MB of source.
# Allowlist only what deploy/api and deploy/www Dockerfiles COPY.
*
!bun.lock
!package.json
!tsconfig.json
!packages
!apps/api
!apps/www

# Images run a fresh `bun install` / `vite build`; host artifacts would
# leak macOS binaries into the Linux image.
**/node_modules
apps/www/dist
apps/www/.tanstack

# Dockerfiles rename .env.production to .env; local .env never ships.
**/.env
